      "notes": "Ubuntu Server 24.04.4 autoinstall plus the ubuntu-desktop metapackage: the plain GNOME desktop kvm-lab installs, on the same ISO the five flavour profiles already use. gdm3 gets the autologin drop-in and the user joins the autologin and nopasswdlogin groups; the post-install asserts an active local graphical session, not just an enabled service. Expect 40-50 minutes: ubuntu-desktop is the largest metapackage of the family.",
